**Summarizing changes and verification instructions**

I’m putting together a concise explanation of the generate process implementation, highlighting updates to configs, IO support for CSV and Parquet, label selection modes, and deterministic RNG. I’ll include clear verification commands with notes on pyarrow requirements and list all changed files at the end, focusing only on relevant code and config modifications while ignoring unrelated environment changes.
codex
Implemented `process=generate` to produce wafer particle samples/particles with deterministic RNG, label selection (ratio/fixed/random), size model application, manifest/metrics, and CSV/Parquet output. Updated config loading so process defaults merge without clobbering CLI overrides, added IO configs, and restructured pattern configs to merge into a single `wafer_particles.patterns` map.

